{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初入道場，三禮已，互跪燒香。散華首者唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唱已，一禮復跪，執爐冥想。眾聖請云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三請，一禮，下同。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "請已起立，稱歎三寶，同聲呪願"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三徧，或更陳敘宣疏，或念佛等，臨時自裁，然後禮讚。唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此同聲和已三禮，下竝同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "讚已，互跪追想存亡父母，懇切至誠懺悔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三徧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此一人唱已，一禮起，繞旋唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "旋繞三稱已，諷盂蘭盆經，或餘經等，盡誠便散。"}
